Day 28 - Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator

📌 Project Overview

Today I built an AI-powered Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator using Claude AI. This interactive web application simulates the complete hospital admission workflow, helping users understand how healthcare providers assess patient readiness before admission.

The simulator recreates real-world healthcare operations by evaluating insurance verification, prior authorization, medical documentation, bed availability, and overall admission readiness.

---

🚀 Features

- Interactive hospital admission workflow
- Patient information management
- Insurance verification process
- Prior Authorization tracking
- Medical documentation validation
- Admission readiness scoring
- Risk identification and mitigation
- Governance & compliance snapshot
- Final admission decision dashboard
- Responsive user interface

---

🔄 Workflow

1. Patient Registration
2. Physician Assessment
3. Diagnosis Selection
4. Admission Type Selection
5. Insurance Verification
6. Prior Authorization Review
7. Documentation Validation
8. Bed Availability Check
9. Admission Readiness Score
10. Risk Resolution
11. Final Admission Decision

